cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this mesh-generation pipeline in research, please cite this
  software and the relevant STAR-CCM+, Nektar++ and Gmsh references. Note that the idustrial pipeline is based on the publication "High-order curvilinear mesh generation from third-party meshes", (Kirilov et al., 2023).
title: Nektar++ STAR-CCM+ Mesh Pipeline
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Wüstenberg
    given-names: Henrik
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0008-3640-5399
abstract: >-
  A reproducible workflow for generating a linear tetrahedral/prismatic
  external-aerodynamics mesh in STAR-CCM+, projecting it onto CAD and
  converting it into a curved high-order Nektar++ mesh with NekMesh.
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/hwuestenberg/nektar-star-pipeline
url: https://github.com/hwuestenberg/nektar-star-pipeline
keywords:
  - computational fluid dynamics
  - high-order mesh generation
  - Nektar++
  - NekMesh
  - STAR-CCM+
  - external aerodynamics
